1
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:54,000
Take an unforgettable journey.

2
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:42,000
Finch is a science fiction, drama, adventure film directed by Miguel Sapochnik.

3
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:30,000
On a post-apocalyptic Earth, a robot, built to protect the life of his dying creator's
beloved dog, learns about life, love, friendship, and what it means to be human.

4
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:18,000
Finch, played by Tom Hanks.

5
00:29:00,000 --> 00:29:06,000
Jeff (voice), played by Caleb Landry Jones.

6
00:34:48,000 --> 00:34:54,000
Truck Driver (Flashback), played by Oscar Avila.

7
00:40:36,000 --> 00:40:42,000
Mother (Flashback), played by Lora Martinez-Cunningham.

8
00:46:24,000 --> 00:46:30,000
Daughter (Flashback), played by Marie Wagenman.

9
00:52:12,000 --> 00:52:18,000
Warning System (voice), played by Emily Jones.

10
00:58:00,000 --> 00:58:06,000
Finch is a 2021 American post-apocalyptic survival film directed by
Miguel Sapochnik and written by Craig Luck and Ivor Powell.

11
01:03:48,000 --> 01:03:54,000
The film stars Tom Hanks and Caleb Landry Jones.

12
01:09:36,000 --> 01:09:42,000
The story follows an aging man named Finch, a survivor in a nearly uninhabitable Earth,
who builds and teaches a robot to take care of his dog when he dies.

13
01:15:24,000 --> 01:15:30,000
The film was announced as BIOS in October 2017.

14
01:21:12,000 --> 01:21:18,000
Filming took place throughout New Mexico and in
Toronto from February to May 2019.

15
01:27:00,000 --> 01:27:06,000
The film was scheduled to be released in theaters in the United States by Universal Pictures on
October 2, 2020, but was delayed several times due to the COVID-19 pandemic.

16
01:32:48,000 --> 01:32:54,000
It was retitled Finch, sold to Apple TV+, and was released on November 5, 2021.

17
01:38:36,000 --> 01:38:42,000
The film received lukewarm reviews from critics, with praise given to Hanks' performance, the visuals, and overall
charm, but criticism for its lack of originality and innovation within the post-apocalypse genre.

18
01:44:24,000 --> 01:44:30,000
The film explores themes of post-apocalyptic future,
robot, taunting, questioning, journey.

19
01:50:12,000 --> 01:50:18,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional and thought_provoking.
